\code{Figs_PERMANOVA}. Each figure is saved in the formats specified by
\code{file_formats}. File names are prefixed by figure type (\code{"PERMDISP_boxplot_"},
\code{"PERMANOVA_ordination_"}) and suffixed by the trait block name.
